SolidCraft Installer (SCI) is a modified work that incorporates parts adapted from Hello Minecraft! Launcher (HMCL).

HMCL source: https://github.com/HMCL-dev/HMCL/tree/acc9740fa9289ded38553b6a35045fd608c1ea99
Copyright (C) 2020-2026 huangyuhui and HMCL contributors.

Adapted components include ordered download-source candidates, retries and fallback, and checksum-verified downloads in:
- src/McDownload/Service/HmclDownloadProvider.cs
- src/McDownload/Service/HmclFetchTask.cs

